    "detailed_description": "<i><strong>Do you like watching tons of units working for you?</strong></i><br><br><strong>Scribbleman Army</strong> is a <strong>colony management</strong> and <strong>idle/clicker</strong> game where you have to explore a cave.<br><br>Collect resources with just a few clicks.<br>Craft units with your resources, they will help you collect, craft and fight.<br>Create new buildings and level up them to unlock new units and new crafts.<br>Upgrade your units to be more productive and more powerful.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134900/extras/da82be8563116998df0663442c12b2a9.poster.avif?t=1668504433\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134900/extras/da82be8563116998df0663442c12b2a9.webm?t=1668504433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134900/extras/da82be8563116998df0663442c12b2a9.mp4?t=1668504433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Prepare for <strong>the battle</strong> if you want to go down to the next level.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134900/extras/a4f2eb7d6e0c8b12a3c3d29e187da6af.poster.avif?t=1668504433\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134900/extras/a4f2eb7d6e0c8b12a3c3d29e187da6af.webm?t=1668504433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134900/extras/a4f2eb7d6e0c8b12a3c3d29e187da6af.mp4?t=1668504433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>You have learnt that your childhood friend has disappeared while trying to explore a new cave.<br>Your duty is to go inside these huge undergrounds and find him!<br>To do so, you will have to be clever, organized and careful. <strong>This cave isn't like the others...</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134900/extras/6851024b04566a67db6223144667753a.poster.avif?t=1668504433\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134900/extras/6851024b04566a67db6223144667753a.webm?t=1668504433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134900/extras/6851024b04566a67db6223144667753a.mp4?t=1668504433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
